                        <li><strong>Explainable AI (XAI):</strong> Creating interpretable models for high-stakes domains
                          like healthcare.</li>
                        <li><strong>NLP & Accessibility:</strong> Leveraging LLMs to build assistive tools for
                          neurodivergent individuals.</li>
                      </ul>
                      <p>I aim to pursue a Ph.D. where I can contribute to making AI more transparent, equitable, and
                        computationally efficient.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

